# 5. USER ROLES AND PERMISSIONS

Implement four distinct roles:

## A. Student

Students can:

- Register and log in.
- Complete their student profile.
- Browse accommodation.
- Search and filter properties.
- View property details.
- Save and remove favourite properties.
- Contact property owners and caretakers.
- Send accommodation enquiries.
