- Moderate Community discussions.
- Manage reported users.
- Review platform activity.
- View audit records.
- Suspend accounts where justified.
- Manage platform settings.

Admin access must be restricted using verified database roles and server-side authorization.

Never rely on hiding buttons or frontend route protection alone.

