- viewing_requests
- reviews

### Communication tables
- conversations
- conversation_participants
- messages
- notifications

### Social tables
- discover_posts
- discover_post_media
- discover_likes
- discover_comments
- discover_saves
- community_categories
- community_posts
- community_comments
- community_likes

### Administration tables
- reports
- moderation_actions
- audit_logs
